{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shape Sweeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wondered what happens when you give roombas a taste for geometric shapes? Welcome to Shape Sweeper, the oddly satisfying idler where your robotic vacuum friends have developed an appetite for circles, squares, and triangles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343570/extras/34bd8fe9e42843c219a78d53acf0658e.gif?t=1747378262\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy an army of shape-hungry roombas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge your roombas to create super-powered collectors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and create super roombas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Huge tech tree with over (50+ upgrades)\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>No roombas were harmed in the making of this game. They're just really, really into geometry.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcab Regular updates and additions planned! \ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343570?t=1747378262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343570/358e2b4733dcc3f1562a589d8de27410b1aa5807/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747378262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343570/eb12768ae374600f4f47263b9c0e0522924cf28e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747378262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343570/eb12768ae374600f4f47263b9c0e0522924cf28e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747378262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detail